enities   \n  \n3 BHK flat is offered for sale in Kanchpada, Mumbai.Situated in Transcon Auris Serenity, it has a prime location. To park your vehicle, this 3 BHK flat is provided with 2 covered parking space. This under construction flat in Kanchpada comes at a price of ₹4.85 Cr. The Dec '30 is possession date. Positioned on 29 floor, the property spans carpet area 1428 sqft. The building comprises 68 floor and contains Kids play area. The flat features power back up, reserved parking, security, service/goods lift, air conditioned, visitor parking, intercom facility. This is a RERA approved project and P51800001413 is the RERA number. Properties in Transcon Auris Serenity are priced between ₹4.55 Cr Onwards, available in 2,3,4 bhk flats options.   Nearby Landmark: Off to link road malad west mumbai.   [View Property](/propertyDetails/3-BHK-1670-Sq-ft-Multistorey-Apartment-FOR-Sale-Kanchpada-in-Mumbai&id=4d423834363537383335)","images":[]},{"url":"https://www.squareyards.com/mumbai-residential-property/sheth-auris-serenity-tower-3/28893/project","title":"Sheth Auris Serenity Tower 3, Malad West, Mumbai - Square Yards","raw_content":"![Squareyards Logo](/assets/images/squareyards.png?aio=w-82;h-32;crop;)\n\n# Sheth Auris Serenity Tower 3 Malad West, Mumbai\n\n![Sheth Auris Serenity Tower 3 Cover Image](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/project-image/sheth-auris-serenity-tower-3-project-project-large-image1.jpg?aio=w-725;h-350;crop;)\n![Sheth Auris Serenity Tower 3 Floor Plans](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/project-image/sheth-auris-serenity-project-floor-plans1.jpg?aio=w-192;h-168;crop;)\n![Sheth Auris Serenity Tower 3 Tower View](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/project-image/sheth-auris-serenity-project-tower-view1.jpg?aio=w-192;h-168;crop;)\n![Sheth Auris Serenity Tower 3 Video](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/tn-projectflagship/tn-sheth-auris-serenity-project-flagship1.jpg?aio=w-192;h-168;crop;)\n\n**₹2.90 Cr - 5.99 Cr**\n\n₹31,434 Per Sq. Ft.\n\n## About Sheth Auris Serenity Tower 3, Malad West by Seth Creators\n\n## Sheth Auris Serenity Tower 3 Price List, Price Trends and Market Insights\n\n### Price List\n\nView the latest price list for Sheth Auris Serenity Tower 3.\n\n| Unit Type (Carpet) | Price\\* | Action |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 2 BHK Apartment  794 Sq. Ft. | **₹ 2.90 Cr** | Check Availability |\n| 2 BHK Apartment  805 Sq. Ft. | **₹ 2.94 Cr** | Check Availability |\n| 3 BHK Apartment  1027 Sq. Ft. | **₹ 3.75 Cr** | Check Availability |\n| 3 BHK Apartment  1233 Sq. Ft. | **₹ 4.50 Cr** | Check Availability |\n| 4 BHK Apartment  1609 Sq. Ft. | **₹ 5.88 Cr** | Check Availability |\n| 4 BHK Apartment  1640 Sq. Ft. | **₹ 5.99 Cr** | Check Availability |\n\n\\*Prices are indicative and subject to applicable charges and project terms.\n\n### Recent Updates\n\nGet the latest price and market updates for Sheth Auris Serenity Tower 3.\n\nA total of 2 residential transactions has been registered so far for Sheth Auris Serenity Tower 3, amounting to ₹ 6 Cr till August 2026.\n\nRent in Sheth Auris Serenity Tower 3 ranges from ₹ 85 K to ₹ 2 L with options available for 2 BHK, 3 BHK, 4 BHK.\n\nDuring Q2'2026, average property prices for Sheth Auris Serenity Tower 3 moved from ₹ 35,750/sqft to ₹ 37,050/sqft, reflecting a 3.64% rise.\n\n#### MMRDA Presents Surplus Budget with Significant Allocation for Infrastructure\n\nMMRDA has presented a surplus budget of ₹48,072 crore, with 87% allocated to infrastructure projects, including roads, public transport, and urban development. A notable provision of ₹4,000 crore is earmarked for the development of Mumbai 3.0 New Town, aiming for planned urban expansion.\n\n#### BMC Budget Includes ₹6,475 Crore for Water Security Projects\n\nThe BMC's FY26-27 budget includes a substantial allocation of ₹6,475 crore for water security initiatives. This funding is designated for projects such as the Manori desalination plant (₹500 crore) and the Gargai project (₹437.51 crore), aimed at augmenting the city's water supply capacity.\n\n#### Mumbai-Pune Expressway 'Missing Link' Project Set for May 1 Inauguration, Promising Safer and Faster Travel\n\nThe highly anticipated 'Missing Link' project on the Mumbai-Pune Expressway is set to be inaugurated on May 1, significantly reducing travel time by approximately 30 minutes and enhancing safety. The 10.5-km stretch features tunnels and a bridge, bypassing the accident-prone Khandala Ghat. This infrastructure upgrade is expected to ease traffic congestion, improve travel safety.\n\nDuring Q4'2025, average property prices for Sheth Auris Serenity Tower 3 moved from ₹ 30,750/sqft to ₹ 38,150/sqft, reflecting a 24.07% rise.\n\nA total of 331 out of 332 launched units have been booked as of December 2025, including 99% of 3 BHK(173 out of 174 units), 100% of 2 BHK(158 units).\n\nStructural Works reach 100% completion, External Works has reached 70%, Internal finishing stands at 57%, MEP Services including lift and staircases, are now 28% done.\n\nA total of 331 out of 332 launched units have been booked as of August 2022, including 99% of 3 BHK(173 out of 174 units), 100% of 2 BHK(158 units).\n\n## Sheth Auris Serenity Tower 3 Floor Plans\n\n![Floor plan of 2 BHK 794 Sq. Ft. Apartment in Sheth Auris Serenity Tower 3, Mumbai](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/unit-image/sheth-auris-serenity-apartment-2-bhk-794sqft-20202716112718.jpg?aio=w-392;h-392;crop;)\n\nPrice:₹ 2.90 Cr\n\n![Floor plan of 2 BHK 805 Sq. Ft. Apartment in Sheth Auris Serenity Tower 3, Mumbai](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/unit-image/sheth-auris-serenity-apartment-2-bhk-805sqft-20202716112755.jpg?aio=w-392;h-392;crop;)\n\nPrice:₹ 2.94 Cr\n\n![Floor plan of 3 BHK 1027 Sq. Ft. Apartment in Sheth Auris Serenity Tower 3, Mumbai](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/unit-image/sheth-auris-serenity-apartment-3-