ironment/am-ico-rainwate-active.svg)\n\n### Specifications\n\n## Location and Connectivity Around Seth Creators Malad West\n\n![Connectivity map showing nearby places around Mumbai Western Suburbs](/assets/images/project-map.png?aio=w-714;h-317;crop;)\n\nEstimate commute from your office or kid's school to Sheth Auris Serenity Tower 3.\n\n![Car travel mode](/assets/images/car-fill.svg)\n![Sheth Auris Serenity Tower 3](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/project-image/sheth-auris-serenity-tower-3-project-project-large-image1.jpg?aio=w-112;h-96;crop;)\n\nPlease select the starting point to calculate the travel time.\n\n![Rolling loader icon](/assets/images/rolling-loader.gif)\n\n### Nearby Landmarks\n\n#### Pinnacle High International School\n\n#### Mariamman Mandir\n\n#### The Childrens Hospital\n\n### Connecting Roads\n\nAverage Asking Price in Malad West\n\nBased on active listings and recent trends\n\nBypass Road development & proposed highway\n\nAbsence of well developed public transport\n\nAndheri West appeals to me because my interactions are practical and lively. I have great colleges nearby, simple metro access, corporate offices etc. Weekends are spent at parks with family as well as at the beach. Though I adore this location, parking problems and noise have to be addressed quickly.\n\n— Smita Deo, Tenant\n\n## RERA Details of Sheth Auris Serenity Tower 3\n\n## How does Sheth Auris Serenity Tower 3 compare with similar projects?\n\n![Sheth Auris Serenity Tower 3 project in Malad West, Mumbai](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/tn-projectflagship/tn-sheth-auris-serenity-project-flagship1.jpg?aio=w-229;h-150;crop;)\n\n### [Sheth Auris Serenity Tower 3](https://www.squareyards.com/mumbai-residential-property/sheth-auris-serenity-tower-3/28893/project \"Sheth Auris Serenity Tower 3\")\n\nMalad West, Mumbai\n\n![Oberoi Realty Exquisite project in Goregaon East, Mumbai](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/tn-projectflagship/tn-oberoi-realty-exquisite-flagshipimg1.jpg?aio=w-229;h-150;crop;)\n\n### [Oberoi Realty Exquisite](https://www.squareyards.com/mumbai-residential-property/oberoi-realty-exquisite/2839/project \"Oberoi Realty Exquisite\")\n\nGoregaon East, Mumbai\n\n![Bhoomi Celestia project in Malad West, Mumbai](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/tn-projectflagship/tn-bhoomi-celestia-flagshipimg1.jpg?aio=w-229;h-150;crop;)\n\n### [Bhoomi Celestia](https://www.squareyards.com/mumbai-residential-property/bhoomi-celestia/2880/project \"Bhoomi Celestia\")\n\nMalad West, Mumbai\n\nSend one enquiry to all selected projects and compare up to 4 options side-by-side.\n\n## Seth Creators Track Record\n\nSeth Creators, a renowned real estate developer in Mumbai, has constantly excelled in the demanding real estate industry for over three decades. Renowned for their innovative thinking, impeccable business acumen, and efficient execution, Seth Creators has become a prominent figure in the real estate market of Mumbai. They made a remarkable entry into the distant suburbs of Mumbai, introducing luxurious townships that revolutionized those markets forever.Their pioneering spirit also extended to upscale locations like South Mumbai and Bandra West, where they elevated the concept of luxury living through their iconic residential projects. Furthermore, Seth Creators used their expertise to leave an indelible mark on Dubai modern skyline with their stunning architectural wonders.Renowned for their ability to spot lucrative opportunities, Seth Creators enjoys a commendable reputation. Their unwavering commitment to exquisite craftsmanship and timely project completion fuels their drive to constantly seek the next potential market, the next exciting collaboration, and the next architectural masterpiece.\n\n![Sheth Beaumonte residential project in Sion East](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/tn-projectflagship/tn-sheth-beaumonte-project-flag