ss being Malad West Mumbai, 400064.\n\n### What documents are required to buy a flat in Sheth Auris Serenity Tower 3?\n\nBuyers need identity proof, address proof, agreement to sell, sale deed, and registration documents for purchasing in Sheth Auris Serenity Tower 3.\n\n### Is Sheth Auris Serenity Tower 3 a Ready to Move project?\n\nYes, Sheth Auris Serenity Tower 3 is a Ready to Move residential project, allowing buyers to take possession immediately without any construction wait.\n\nThis website is only for the purpose of providing information regarding real estate projects in different geographies. Any information which is being provided on this website is not an advertisement or a solicitation. The company has not verified the information and the compliances of the projects. Further, the company has not checked the RERA\\* registration status of the real estate projects listed herein. The company does not make any representation in regards to the compliances done against these projects. Please note that you should make yourself aware about the RERA\\* registration status of the listed real estate projects.\n\n**\\*Real Estate (Regulation & Development) Act, 2016.**\n\n![Bangalore city icon](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/bangalore.svg)\n![Chennai city icon](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/chennai.svg)\n![Delhi city icon](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/delhi.svg)\n![Gurgaon city icon](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/gurgaon.svg)\n![Hyderabad city icon](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/hyderabad.svg)\n![Kolkata city icon](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/kolkata.svg)\n![Lucknow city icon](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/lucknow.svg)\n![Mumbai city icon](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/mumbai.svg)\n![Navi Mumbai city icon](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/navi-mumbai.svg)\n![Noida city icon](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/noida.svg)\n![Pune city icon](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/pune.svg)\n![Thane city icon](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/thane.svg)\n\nSquare Yards is India's largest Integrated real estate platform, with category leadership presence across multiple touchpoints of consumer home ownership journey. With Urbanisation and rising disposable incomes as the core theme, Square Yards, with 8mn+ monthly traffic and ~USD 7bn+ GTV, is the largest and asset light proxy play to the growing residential demand story of India. One of the few Indian start ups to taste global success with presence in 100+ cities across 9 countries, Square Yards is at the forefront of tech adoption in the sector, with multiple patents across VR/AI domains.\n\n![SQUAREYARDS ANDROID APP](https://static.squareyards.com/ui-assets/images/google-play.png)\n![SQUAREYARDS IOS APP](https://static.squareyards.com/ui-assets/images/app-store.png)\n![loader](/assets/images/loader3-big.gif)","images":[]},{"url":"https://www.squareyards.com/mumbai-residential-property/sheth-auris-serenity-tower-1/100893/project","title":"Sheth Auris Serenity Tower 1, Malad West, Mumbai - Price Starts from ₹2.88 Cr Onwards | 2, 3, 4 BHK Flats Available","raw_content":"![Squareyards Logo](/assets/images/squareyards.png?aio=w-82;h-32;crop;)\n![Sheth Creators developer logo](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/developerlogo/sheth-creators-2352.jpg?aio=w-128;h-128;crop;)\n\n# Sheth Auris Serenity Tower 1 Malad West, Mumbai\n\n![Sheth Auris Serenity Tower 1 Cover Image](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/project-image/sheth-auris-serenity-tower-1-project-project-large-image1.jpg?aio=w-725;h-350;crop;)\n![Sheth Auris Serenity Tower 1 Apartment Interiors](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/project-image/auris-serenity--project-apartment-interiors1.jpg?aio=w-192;h-168;crop;)\n![Sheth Auris Serenity Tower 1 Apartment Interiors](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/project-image/auris-serenity--project-apartment-interiors2.jpg?aio=w-192;h-168;crop;)\n![Sheth Auris Serenity Tower 1 Video](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/tn-projectflagship/tn-auris-serenity--project-flagship1.jpg?aio=w-192;h-168;crop;)\n\n**₹2.88 Cr - 5.71 Cr**\n\n₹31,434 Per Sq. Ft.\n\n## About Sheth Auris Serenity Tower 1, Malad West by Sheth Creators\n\n## Sheth Auris Serenity Tower 1 Price List, Price Trends and Market Insights\n\n### Price List\n\nView the latest price list for Sheth Auris Serenity Tower 1.\n\n| Unit Type (Carpet) | Price\\* | Action |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 2 BHK Apartment  799 Sq. Ft. | **₹ 2.88 Cr** | Check Availability |\n| 2 BHK Apartment  805 Sq. Ft. | **₹ 2.90 Cr** | Check Availability |\n| 3 BHK Apartment  1202 Sq. Ft. | **₹ 4.36 Cr** | Check Availability |\n| 3 BHK Apartment  1321 Sq. Ft. | **₹ 4.70 Cr** | Check Availability |\n| 4 BHK Apartment  1609 Sq. Ft. | **₹ 5.68 Cr** | Check Availability |\n| 4 BHK Apartment  1617 Sq. Ft. | **₹ 5.71 Cr** | Check Availability |\n\n\\*Prices are indicative and subject to applicable charges and project terms.\n\n### Price Trends\n\nSheth Auris Serenity Tower 1's average asking price is cooling quarter-on-quarter, compared with Malad West.\n\nSep 2025 — Jun 2026\n\n| Quarter | Sheth Auris Serenity Tower 1 | Malad West |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| Jun 2026 | 36650 | 30550 |\n| Mar 2026 | 39050 | 30150 |\n| Dec 2025 | 36650 | 28850 |\n| Sep 2025 | 34400 | 27900 |\n\n### Comparable Projects\n\nSheth Auris Serenity Tower 1 avg. price is ₹ 36.6 K/Sq.Ft. compared to Malad West at ₹ 30.6 K/Sq.Ft.\n\n| Project | Avg. ₹/sq ft |\n| --- | --- |\n| [Kolte Patil Verve](https://www.squareyards.com/mumbai-residential-property/kolte-patil-verve/104015/project \"Kolte Patil Verve\") | ₹ 37,200 |\n| Current Project **Sheth Auris Serenity Tower 1** | ₹ 36,650 |\n| [Ruparel Palacio Phase 1](https://www.squareyards.com/mumbai-residential-property/ruparel-palacio-phase-1/100564/project \"Ruparel Palacio Phase 1\") | ₹ 35,100 |\n| [JP Decks](https://www.squareyards.com/mumbai-residential-property/jp-decks/5392/project \"JP Decks\") | ₹ 31,700 |\n| Malad West | ₹ 30,550 |\n\n### Rentals\n\nMonthly Rent in Sheth Auris Serenity Tower 1 start from ₹ 81.5 K with options available for 2 BHK units\n\n| Configuration | In Sheth Auris Serenity Tower 1 | In Malad West |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 1 BHK | - | ₹ 38.3 K |\n| 2 BHK | ₹ 81.5 K | ₹ 62.4 K |\n| 3 BHK | - | ₹ 80.4 K |\n| 4 BHK | - | ₹ 1.3 L |\n\n### Recent Updates\n\nGet the latest price and market updates for Sheth Auris Serenity Tower 1.\n\nA total of 10 residential transactions has been registered so far for Sheth Auris Serenity Tower 1, amounting to ₹ 29 Cr till September 2026.\n\nRent in Sheth Auris Serenity Tower 1 ranges from ₹ 82 K to ₹ 2 L with options available for 2 BHK, 3 BHK, 4 BHK.\n\n#### MMRDA Presents Surplus Budget with Significant Allocation for Infrastructure\n\nMMRDA has presented a surplus budget of ₹48,072 crore, with 87% allocated to infrastructure projects, including roads, public transport, and urban development. A notable provision of ₹4,000 crore is earmarked for the development of Mumbai 3.0 New Town, aiming for planned urban expansion.\n\n#### BMC Budget Includes ₹6,475 Crore for Water Security Projects\n\nThe BMC's FY26-27 budget includes a substantial allocation of ₹6,475 crore for water security initiatives. This funding is designated for projects such as the Manori desalination plant (₹500 crore) and the Gargai project (₹437.51 crore), aimed at augmenting the city's water supply capacity.\n\n#### Mumbai-Pune Expressway 'Missing Link' Project Set for May 1 Inauguration, Promising Safer and Faster Travel\n\nThe highly anticipated 'Missing Link' project on the Mumbai-Pune Expressway is set to be inaugurated on May 1, significantly reducing travel time by approximately 30 minutes and enhancing safety. The 10.5-km stretch features tunnels and a bridge, bypassing the accident-prone Khandala Ghat. This infrastructure upgrade is expected to ease traffic congestion, improve travel safety.\n\nStructural Works reach 100% completion. External Works has reached 95%. Internal finishing stands at 98%. MEP Services including lift and staircases, are now 95% done\n\nDuring Q1'2026, average property prices for Sheth Auris Serenity Tower 1 moved from ₹ 36,650/sqft to ₹ 39,050/sqft, reflecting a 6.55% rise.\n\nDuring Q4'2025, average property prices for Sheth Auris Serenity Tower 1 moved from ₹ 34,400/sqft to ₹ 36,650/sqft, reflecting a 6.54% rise.\n\nA total of 330 out of 333 launched units have been booked as of December 2025, including 99% of 3 BHK(115 out of 116 units), 99% of 2 BHK(157 out of 159 units), 100% of 4 BHK(58 units).\n\nA total of 333 out of 333 launched units have been booked as of June 2022, including , 100% of 4 BHK(58 units), 3 BHK(116 units), 2 BHK(159 units).\n\n### Govt. Registrations\n\n10 Sales Transactions Registered in Sheth Auris Serenity Tower 1 From Oct 25 to Sep 26 at Avg. Price ₹ 29.3 K/Sq.Ft.\n\n| Sales Transactions | Gross Sales Value | Registered Rate |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 10 | ₹ 29 Cr | ₹ 29,300 / Sq. Ft. |\n\nTransaction Period Oct 25 to Sep 26\n\n## Sheth Auris Serenity Tower 1 Floor Plans\n\n![Floor plan of 2 BHK 799 Sq. Ft. Apartment in Sheth Auris Serenity Tower 1, Mumbai](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/unit-image/auris-serenity--apartment-2-bhk-799sqft-20203811093815.jpg?aio=w-392;h-392;crop;)\n\nPrice:₹ 2.88 Cr\n\n![Floor plan of 2 BHK 805 Sq. Ft. Apartment in Sheth Auris Serenity Tower 1, Mumbai](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/unit-image/auris-serenity--apartment-2-bhk-805sqft-20203811093845.jpg?aio=w-392;h-392;crop;)\n\nPrice:₹ 2.90 Cr\n\n![Floor plan of 3 BHK 1202 Sq. Ft. Apartment in Sheth Auris Serenity Tower 1, Mumbai](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/unit-image/auris-serenity--apartment-3-bhk-1202sqft-20203911093937.jpg?aio=w-392;h-392;crop;)\n\nPrice:₹ 4.36 Cr\n\n![Floor plan of 3 BHK 1321 Sq. Ft. Apartment in Sheth Auris Serenity Tower 1, Mumbai](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/unit-image/auris-serenity--apartment-3-bhk-1321sqft-20204011094035.jpg?aio=w-392;h-392;crop;)\n\nPrice:₹ 4.70 Cr\n\n![Floor plan of 4 BHK 1609 Sq. Ft. Apartment in Sheth Auris Serenity Tower 1, Mumbai](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/unit-image/auris-serenity--apartment-4-bhk-1609sqft-20204111094105.jpg?aio=w-392;h-392;crop;)\n\nPrice:₹ 5.68 Cr\n\n![Floor plan of 4 BHK 1617 Sq. Ft. Apartment in Sheth Auris Serenity Tower 1, Mumbai](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/unit-image/auris-serenity--apartment-4-bhk-1617sqft-20204111094148.jpg?aio=w-392;h-392;crop;)\n\nPrice:₹ 5.71 Cr\n\n## Resale & Rental Listings in Sheth Auris Serenity Tower 1\n\nExplore resale and rental listings currently available in Sheth Auris Serenity Tower 1, Mumbai.\n\n![2 BHK + Pooja Room Apartment For Sale in Sheth Auris Serenity Tower 1 in Malad West, Mumbai]()\n\nMalad West, Mumbai\n\n![Sanket Mehta  profile picture]()\n![2 BHK Apartment For Sale in Sheth Auris Serenity Tower 1 in Malad West, Mumbai]()\n\nMalad West, Mumbai\n\n![2 BHK Apartment For Sale in Sheth Auris Serenity Tower 1 in Malad West, Mumbai]()\n\nMalad West, Mumbai\n\n![Maa sheetala properties  profile picture]()\n![3 BHK Apartment For Sale in Sheth Auris Serenity Tower 1 in Malad West, Mumbai]()\n\nMalad West, Mumbai\n\n![Vijay Sharma  profile picture]()\n![3 BHK Apartment For Sale in Sheth Auris Serenity Tower 1 in Malad West, Mumbai]()\n\nMalad West, Mumbai\n\n![3 BHK + Pooja Room Apartment For Sale in Sheth Auris Serenity Tower 1 in Malad West, Mumbai]()\n\nMalad West, Mumbai\n\n![Vijay Sharma  profile picture]()\n![3.5 BHK + Servant Room Apartment For Sale in Sheth Auris Serenity Tower 1 in Malad West, Mumbai]()\n\nMalad West, Mumbai\n\n![3.5 BHK Apartment For Sale in Sheth Auris Serenity Tower 1 in Malad West, Mumbai]()\n\nMalad West, Mumbai\n\n![Maa sheetala properties  profile picture]()\n![3.5 BHK Apartment For Sale in Sheth Auris Serenity Tower 1 in Malad West, Mumbai]()\n\nMala