//static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/project-image/auris-serenity--project-apartment-interiors1.jpg?aio=w-192;h-168;crop;)\n![Sheth Auris Serenity Tower 1 Apartment Interiors](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/project-image/auris-serenity--project-apartment-interiors2.jpg?aio=w-192;h-168;crop;)\n![Sheth Auris Serenity Tower 1 Video](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/tn-projectflagship/tn-auris-serenity--project-flagship1.jpg?aio=w-192;h-168;crop;)\n\nDownload brochure, master plan & walkthrough video of Sheth Auris Serenity Tower 1 to explore floor plans, layout, and complete project details in Malad West, Mumbai.\n\n### Project Brochure\n\nComplete details about the Project\n\n### Master Plan\n\nOverall project layout & design\n\n### Walkthrough Video\n\nVirtual tour of the property\n\n## Amenities & Specifications of Sheth Auris Serenity Tower 1\n\n### Sports Sports\n\n![Sports](https://static.squareyards.com/assets/images/svg/amenities/sports/am-ico-gymnasiu-active.svg)\n\n### Convenience Convenience\n\n![Convenience](https://static.squareyards.com/assets/images/svg/amenities/convenience/am-ico-powerbac-active.svg)\n\n### Safety Safety\n\n![Safety](https://static.squareyards.com/assets/images/svg/amenities/safety/am-ico-24x7secu-active.svg)\n\n### Leisure Leisure\n\n![Leisure](https://static.squareyards.com/assets/images/svg/amenities/leisure/am-ico-sauna-active.svg)\n\n### Environment Environment\n\n![Environment](https://static.squareyards.com/assets/images/svg/amenities/environment/am-ico-rainwate-active.svg)\n\n### Specifications\n\n## Location and Connectivity Around Sheth Creators Malad West\n\n![Connectivity map showing nearby places around Mumbai Western Suburbs](/assets/images/project-map.png?aio=w-714;h-317;crop;)\n\nEstimate commute from your office or kid's school to Sheth Auris Serenity Tower 1.\n\n![Car travel mode](/assets/images/car-fill.svg)\n![Sheth Auris Serenity Tower 1](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/project-image/sheth-auris-serenity-tower-1-project-project-large-image1.jpg?aio=w-112;h-96;crop;)\n\nPlease select the starting point to calculate the travel time.\n\n![Rolling loader icon](/assets/images/rolling-loader.gif)\n\n### Nearby Landmarks\n\n#### Pinnacle High International School\n\n#### Mariamman Mandir\n\n#### The Childrens Hospital\n\n### Connecting Roads\n\nAverage Asking Price in Malad West\n\nBased on active listings and recent trends\n\nBypass Road development & proposed highway\n\nAbsence of well developed public transport\n\nAndheri West appeals to me because my interactions are practical and lively. I have great colleges nearby, simple metro access, corporate offices etc. Weekends are spent at parks with family as well as at the beach. Though I adore this location, parking problems and noise have to be addressed quickly.\n\n— Smita Deo, Tenant\n\n## RERA Details of Sheth Auris Serenity Tower 1\n\n## Property Registration Data\n\n10 Sales Transactions Registered in Sheth Auris Serenity Tower 1 From Oct 25 to Sep 26 at Avg. Price ₹ 29.3 K/Sq.Ft.\n\n| Registry Date | Floor/Unit | Tower/Wing | Area | Transaction Value | Rate/Sq. Ft. | Actions |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| 2026-03-05 | Floor 44, Unit 4406 | 1 | 807 Sq. Ft. |  |  | Index    Agreement |\n| 2026-02-18 | Floor 24, Unit 2406 | 1 | 763 Sq. Ft. |  |  | Index    Agreement |\n| 2026-02-11 | Floor 3, Unit E-310 | N/A | 563 Sq. Ft. |  |  | Index    Agreement |\n| 2025-12-24 | Floor 20, Unit 2004 | 2 | 1,579 Sq. Ft. |  |  | Index    Agreement |\n| 2025-12-03 | Floor 56, Unit 5601 | 2 | 805 Sq. Ft. |  |  | Index    Agreement |\n| 2025-11-12 | Floor 9, Unit 905 | 2 | 1,312 Sq. Ft. |  |  | Index    Agreement |\n| 2025-11-04 | Floor 28, Unit 2808 | 1 | 777 Sq. Ft. |  |  | Index    Agreement |\n| 2025-10-10 | Floor 18, Unit 1806 | 1 | 807 Sq. Ft. |  |  | Index    Agreement |\n| 2025-10-09 | Floor 52, Unit 5205 | 3 | 1,080 Sq. Ft. |  |  | Index    Agreement |\n| 2025-10-08 | Floor 11, Unit 1102 | 3 | 806 Sq. Ft. |  |  | Index    Agreement |\n\n## How does Sheth Auris Serenity Tower 1 compare with similar projects?\n\n![Sheth Auris Serenity Tower 1 project in Malad West, Mumbai](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/tn-projectflagship/tn-auris-serenity--project-flagship1.jpg?aio=w-229;h-150;crop;)\n\n### [Sheth Auris Serenity Tower 1](https://www.squareyards.com/mumbai-residential-property/sheth-auris-serenity-tower-1/100893/project \"Sheth Auris Serenity Tower 1\")\n\nMalad West, Mumbai\n\n![The Wadhwa Anmol Fortune project in Goregaon West, Mumbai](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/tn-projectflagship/tn-the-wadhwa-anmol-fortune-project-flagship1.jpg?aio=w-229;h-150;crop;)\n\n### [The Wadhwa Anmol Fortune](https://www.squareyards.com/mumbai-residential-property/the-wadhwa-anmol-fortune/2826/project \"The Wadhwa Anmol Fortune\")\n\nGoregaon West, Mumbai\n\n![Bhoomi Celestia project in Malad West, Mumbai](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/tn-projectflagship/tn-bhoomi-celestia-flagshipimg1.jpg?aio=w-229;h-150;crop;)\n\n### [Bhoomi Celestia](https://www.squareyards.com/mumbai-residential-property/bhoomi-celestia/2880/project \"Bhoomi Celestia\")\n\nMalad West, Mumbai\n\nSend one enquiry to all selected projects and compare up to 4 options side-by-side.\n\n## Sheth Auris Serenity Tower 1 Reviews & Ratings\n\nRead the reviews about Sheth Auris Serenity Tower 1 located at Malad West Mumbai and see what residents and real estate experts have to say about the project.\n\nReal estate agent\n\n![Sheth Auris Serenity Tower 1 review image]()\n\nNice security guard full safety neat and clean greenery garden playing area and many more amenities\n\nOwner\n\nOkay, this place is GORGEOUS!! I’ve stayed here for a month now and it’s been an amazing\nchange up from my last apartment. The entire project is surrounded by parks and carefully\ntended greenery. Rooms are not that big but have large windows and glass terrace doors for\nmaximum natural lighting. One small problem I have is that the nearby roads are almost\nalways congested, especially in the mornings.\n\nOwner\n\nI would say this project is perfect for small families and couples given the size of the rooms.\nMy 2BHK apartment is 805 sq. ft. which is perfect for my family (my wife and son). Things\nlike the kids’ pool and badminton court make it even better since we can enjoy all of those\ntogether.\n\nOwner\n\nWe bought our apartment at Sheth Auris Serenity Tower 1 just a couple of days ago and it’s\nbeen pretty nice so far. The other people on my floor actually came to help us unpack and\ncarry our boxes in! I haven’t checked out all the facilities here but I’m looking forward to\nsoaking in the sauna for sure.\n\nOwner\n\nI moved into Sheth Auris Serenity Tower 1 more than three weeks ago. I honestly can’t find\nenough good things to say about this place! The rooms are beautiful and have great soft\nlighting, the security features are a big relief, and recreational facilities like a spa, sauna, and\nclubhouse make it significantly upscale.\n\nOwner\n\nBest thing about Sheth Auris Serenity is it doesn’t take too long for you to feel at home. My\n2bhk apartment is painted entirely in soft warm colors that makes it feel very welcoming.\nSurprised to see that the kitchen is actually adequately sized for once. The project is not\nvery far from New Link road however, so finding parking can be hard late at night.\n\n## Sheth Creators Track Record\n\n![Sheth Creators logo](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/developerlogo/sheth-creators-2352.jpg?aio=w-300;h-300;fill;)\n![Sheth Auris Serenity Tower 4 residential project in Malad West](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/tn-projectflagship/tn-sheth-auris-serenity-tower-4-project-flagship.jpg?aio=w-230;h-145;crop;)\n\nMalad West, Mumbai\n\n3, 4 BHK Apartment, Retail Shop, Office Space\n\n₹ 4.80 Cr to 7.07 Cr\n\n![Sheth Vasant Blossom residential project in Marol](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/tn-projectflagship/tn-sheth-vasant-blossom-project-flagship1.jpg?aio=w-230;h-145;crop;)\n\nMarol, Mumbai\n\n2, 3 BHK Apartment\n\n₹ 2.45 Cr to 3.23 Cr\n\n![Sheth Vasant Oasis Camelia residential project in Andheri East](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/tn-projectflagship/tn-sheth-vasant-oasis-camelia-project-flagship1.jpg?aio=w-230;h-145;crop;)\n\nAndheri East, Mumbai\n\n2 BHK Apartment\n\n₹ 2.12 Cr to 2.68 Cr\n\n![Sheth Creators Vasant Oasis Lillium Bldg 16 residential project in Andheri East](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/tn-projectflagship/tn-sheth-creators-vasant-oasis-lillium-bldg-16-project-flagship1.jpg?aio=w-230;h-145;crop;)\n\nAndheri East, Mumbai\n\n3, 4, 5 BHK Apartment\n\n₹ 4.55 Cr to 6.77 Cr\n\n![Sheth Vasant Oasis Daffodil Bldg 7 residential project in Andheri East](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/tn-projectflagship/tn-sheth-vasant-oasis-daffodil-bldg-7-project-flagship1.jpg?aio=w-230;h-145;crop;)\n\nAndheri East, Mumbai\n\n1, 2, 3 BHK Apartment\n\n₹ 1.49 Cr to 3.54 Cr\n\n![Vasant Oasis Phase I residential project in Andheri East](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/tn-projectflagship/tn-vasant-oasis-phase-i-project-flagship1.jpg?aio=w-230;h-145;crop;)\n\nAndheri East, Mumbai\n\n1, 2, 3 BHK Apartment\n\n₹ 1.37 Cr to 2.79 Cr\n\n![Sheth Vasant Oasis Phase III residential project in Andheri East](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/tn-projectflagship/tn-sheth-vasant-oasis-phase-iii-project-flagship1.jpg?aio=w-230;h-145;crop;)\n\nAndheri East, Mumbai\n\n1, 2, 3 BHK Apartment\n\n₹ 1.36 Cr to 3.36 Cr\n\n![Sheth Auris Ilaria Tower A residential project in Malad West](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/tn-projectflagship/tn-sheth-auris-ilaria-tower-a-project-flagship.jpg?aio=w-230;h-145;crop;)\n\nMalad West, Mumbai\