h-creators-private-limited)\n\nRegistered MahaRERA name: Auris Serenity Tower 3\n\n📍 Malad West, Mumbai Suburban · 400064\n\nCertificate Signed\n\n**Completed/historical project — current inventory unconfirmed**\n\nAsk an advisor to check current resale or rental availability.\n\nSource stage: Sold Out · mapped resale: 0 · mapped rental: 0 · primary status: recorded\n\nPooja Batra · Senior Advisor\n\nMumbai Property Exchange · MahaRERA-registered since 2017\n\n[📞 Call](tel:+919819311244)[💬 WhatsApp](https://wa.me/919820067525?text=Hi%20MPE%2C%20I%20have%20a%20property%20query)\n\n★\n\n## Gallery\n\n![Auris Serenity Tower 3](https://www.mumbaipropertyexchange.com/img/projects/25039/25039-oth-sheth-auris-serenity-2-elevation-1-malad(w).webp)![Auris Serenity Tower 3](https://www.mumbaipropertyexchange.com/img/projects/25039/25039-oth-sheth-auris-serenity-2-entrance.webp)![Auris Serenity Tower 3](https://www.mumbaipropertyexchange.com/img/projects/25039/25039-oth-sheth-auris-serenity-2-image-2.webp)![Auris Serenity Tower 3](https://www.mumbaipropertyexchange.com/img/projects/25039/25039-oth-sheth-auris-serenity-2-image-3.webp)![Auris Serenity Tower 3](https://www.mumbaipropertyexchange.com/img/projects/25039/25039-oth-sheth-auris-serenity-2-image-4.webp)![Auris Serenity Tower 3](https://www.mumbaipropertyexchange.com/img/projects/25039/25039-oth-auris-serenity-2-malad-west-living-room-1.webp)![Auris Serenity Tower 3](https://www.mumbaipropertyexchange.com/img/projects/25039/25039-oth-sheth-auris-serenity-living-room-2.webp)![Auris Serenity Tower 3](https://www.mumbaipropertyexchange.com/img/projects/25039/25039-oth-sheth-auris-serenity-bedroom-1.webp)![Auris Serenity Tower 3](https://www.mumbaipropertyexchange.com/img/projects/25039/25039-oth-sheth-auris-serenity-dining-room-1.webp)![Auris Serenity Tower 3](https://www.mumbaipropertyexchange.com/img/projects/25039/25039-oth-sheth-auris-serenity-dining-room-image-2.webp)![Auris Serenity Tower 3](https://www.mumbaipropertyexchange.com/img/projects/25039/25039-oth-sheth-auris-serenity-dining-room-image-3.webp)![Auris Serenity Tower 3](https://www.mumbaipropertyexchange.com/img/projects/25039/25039-oth-sheth-auris-serenity-amenities-1.webp)\n\ni\n\n## Overview\n\n**Auris Serenity Tower 2 i**s a Under Construction Project and the location is Opp Landmark Restaurant, Malad West and is developed by **Sheth Creators Pvt Ltd**.\n\n**Auris Serenity Tower 2 has the possession in Dec 2020.**\n\nAuris Serenity Tower2, Malad(W) provides homes with sea view & tranquility. Auris Serenity bears the status of tallest & largest residential address of Malad(W). Aurius Serenity Tower 2 provides International Standard of  living with all amenities at ones door step.\n\n**Auris Serenity Tower 2 registered under the Maharashtra Real Estate Regulatory Authority and its RERA ID is P51800001413** |  **Auris Serenity Tower 3 P51800001082 - Possession Dec 2023**\n\nSheth Creators Pvt Ltd also has other under construction and ready possession and sold out projects like Golden Willows, Green Ash, Beaumonde, Cascade, Silver Birch, Vasant Galaxy, Vasant Lawns, Grace, Polaris, Ivy, Vasant Grandeur, Silver Bell, Saraswati, Vasant Pride, Sheth Clarion, Greens, Athena, Vasant Glade, Fiona, Sheth Beaupride, Vasant Oasis , Auris Serenity, Sheth Beaumonte, Auris Bliss, Irene, One Marina, Auris Serenity Tower 2, Sheth Beaumonte Tower B, Vasant Oasis Tower 15 Danica, Sheth Vasant Oasis Jolan Tower 14, Sheth Zuri, Sheth Avalon, Sheth Montana Rosa , Sheth Midori.\n\n**The property prices in Malad West** are in the range of 13500 to 18500 for Outright for ready and under construction projects.\n\n**Auris Serenity Tower 2** **has good reviews and the ratings of this project are approximately 5 out of 5.**\n\n#### Highlights Of Auris Serenity:\n\n* Built 18000 homes\n* Constructed 60 mixed-use developments (completed & ongoing)\n* Won 32 international awards\n* Taken up 20 mn. sq. ft. for development in India & abroad\n* 2BHK & 3BHK apartments have 1 Car Park while 4BHK has 2 Car Parks.\n* 7 level car parking comprises of more than 3000+ cars parking capacity.\n* Typology for **Auris Serenity 2** - 2BHK, 3BHK & 4BHK | **Auris Serenity 3 -** 2BHK & 3BHK\n* Received LEED Certification, ISO 9001:2008 & ISO 14001:2004 certifications\n* Sea –view facing apartments off Link road.\n* 1st habitable floor at 98ft. from ground level.\n* 2 club houses of 2 levels each. | 2 large swimming pools.\n* Open layout with no negative spaces.\n* Secured gated community.\n* International architects and Landscape Consultants from Singapore.\n\n**You can download the brochure of Auris Serenity Tower 2** and you can see the latest digital pictures, Floor Plans, Location Plans & Rate History on our website. The Bookings for the Under Construction project Auris Serenity Tower 2 are open and we can set up a Site Visit any time at your Convenience.Auris Serenity Tower 2 is approved by most of the Banks and for more details on the approved bank list, please connect with us.\n\n₹\n\n## Price vs Locality\n\n₹28,261\n\n/sqft · locality avg **₹42,500**\n\n34% below avg\n\n₹\n\n## Malad West — resale, rent & yield\n\nResale\n\n₹27,000/sqft\n\nmedian · 55 listings\n\nRent\n\n₹78.1/sqft/mo\n\n2 BHK ~₹65,000/mo\n\nGross yield\n\n3.5%/yr\n\nrent vs resale value\n\nThis project is quoted around **₹28,261/sqft** — **5% above** resale here.\n\nFrom MPE live listings, last 18 months · [Mumbai price index ›](/mumbai-property-price-index)\n\n01\n\n## Possession Timeline\n\nProposed\n\nDec 2024\n\nRevised\n\nDec 2024\n\nStatus\n\nOngoing\n\n02\n\n## Unit Configurations (per MahaRERA)\n\nConfigurationCarpetIndicative Price\n\n2 BHK794–809 ft²₹2.24 Cr–₹2.29 Cr\n\n3 BHK1,027–1,338 ft²₹2.9 Cr–₹3.78 Cr\n\nConfigurations & carpet per MahaRERA filing · indicative price = locality rate × carpet (not the developer's quote).\n\n[💬 Verify current inventory with an advisor](https://wa.me/919820067525?text=I%20am%20looking%20to%20buy%20a%20home